  "description": "MACSOC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C120 H122 F6 N6 O36 S2 Yb6 4+,2(C1 F3 O3 S1 1-),2(H1 O1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb5 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb6 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.517-3.654 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.20-110.58°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C122H122F12N6O44S4Yb6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
